      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits where north and south forks of the Salmon River meet, giving it its name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forks_of_Salmon%2C_California",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Over 98% of surrounding land is national forest managed by the U.S. Forest Service.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
