      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forks_of_Salmon%2C_California",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Forks of Salmon has had its own post office since 1858, operating continuously except a brief 1871‑72 break.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forks_of_Salmon%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The area lacks utility‑provided electricity and cellular service, making it one of California’s most isolated communities.",
